In article <JUHANA.RASANEN.92Jul12151723@vipunen.hut.fi> Juhana.Rasanen@hut.fi (Juhana R{s{nen) writes:
>Well, the subjectline says about it all: I installed 2.04 in my B2000 and
>suddenly the nethack.font doesn't load anymore; the system default font is
>used instead. I tried moving it from nethack: to fonts: but that didn't help.
>Is this a bug in NH (3.0j) or am I doing something wrong? Anybody got it
>working under 2.04?
This is documented in the Install.ami file we shipped with 3.0j - you
need to move the font to FONTS:, run fixfonts on it, then put it back
in nethack:.  If this doesn't do it for you, please let us know.
